Package: sastestgenerator
Title: Generate SAS Macro Test Cases from Functional Requirements
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Ramnath", "Dhadage", email = "ram.dhadage123@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides a small proof-of-concept workflow for reading SAS macro
    code and functional requirements, constructing an LLM prompt, and returning
    structured SAS test-generation results.
